<title>USA: CBOT soybean deliveries - Aug 30.</title>
<headline>CBOT soybean deliveries - Aug 30.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-08-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Delivery notices against the September soybean contract for September 3 (In thousand bushels).</p>
<p>SOYBEANS - 40. Up to June 3, 1996.</p>
<p>Delivered - Term Commodities/h 35, Lind-Waldock/c 5.</p>
<p>Received - LFG/c 10, Smith Barney/c 15, Lind-Waldock/c 5, ADM Investor Services/c 5, Dean Witter/c 5.</p>
<p>H=house account. C=Customer Account.</p>
<p>Source: Chicago Board of Trade Clearing Corp.</p>
<p>(Chicago newsdesk 312 408 8720)</p>
</text>
